<finishSceneLongDesc>
This is the long description for the end scene action. It's defined in the XML. 

This means that it can include variables like the PC's eye colour which is $w.eyeColour.

It also makes it straightforward to have longer text that spreads over multiple lines. As such, long action descriptions will often be worth adding to this file.

Incidentally, the End Scene action ends the scene. You know, in case it wasn't obvious from the short description.
</finishSceneLongDesc>

